            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Repara brinquedos</u></strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/24cd14b64c2a7405e0550e3ae7e6001b.poster.avif?t=1789120906\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/24cd14b64c2a7405e0550e3ae7e6001b.webm?t=1789120906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/24cd14b64c2a7405e0550e3ae7e6001b.mp4?t=1789120906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Desmonta/monta peças de brinquedos e começa a tua jornada de reparação: limpeza, pintura, limpeza com jato de areia, revestimento, lixagem, costura, preenchimento/estofagem, etc.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Repara o máximo de brinquedos possíveis para ganhares dinheiro e experiência</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tira fotos do antes e depois para veres o progresso</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Decora o teu escritório e oficina</u></strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/d45acbae8c978ccec26d13f9d0090624.poster.avif?t=1789120906\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/d45acbae8c978ccec26d13f9d0090624.webm?t=1789120906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/d45acbae8c978ccec26d13f9d0090624.mp4?t=1789120906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compra mobília, carpetes, quadros, plantas, flores, etc. e decora o teu escritório</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compra novas ferramentas e equipamentos para aumentares o teu portfólio</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Inicia o teu próprio museu de brinquedos</u></strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/b925b3c5a8f8292bd2b97538a7b00725.poster.avif?t=1789120906\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/b925b3c5a8f8292bd2b97538a7b00725.webm?t=1789120906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/b925b3c5a8f8292bd2b97538a7b00725.mp4?t=1789120906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compra e repara brinquedos únicos</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compra novos edifícios e decora os teus museus de brinquedos</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Joga com brinquedos principais</u></strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/2aa995826c2dc4d0a0a40a144170d445.poster.avif?t=1789120906\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/2aa995826c2dc4d0a0a40a144170d445.webm?t=1789120906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510580/extras/2aa995826c2dc4d0a0a40a144170d445.mp4?t=1789120906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Aumenta de nível e torna-te um mestre</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Joga com brinquedos principais após a concretização de encomendas com sucesso</li></ul>",
